!/api/public/local/routes/rabit-api.php
/api/public/local/composer.lock

# Docs
/docs/*
!/docs/.gitkeep
!/docs/api.md
!/docs/domain.md
!/docs/modules.md
!/docs/scenario.md

# RaBit API current documentation
!/docs/README.md
